units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region simbox block 0 66.016 0 66.016 -81.016 132.032 units box
create_box 1 simbox
region target block 0 66.016 0 66.016 0 132.032 units box
region projectile block 0 66.016 0 66.016 -81.016 -15 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
mass 1 92.90638
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
group mobile union target projectile
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity mobile create 300 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian units box
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz vol
thermo_modify flush yes
fix equil mobile nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
velocity projectile add 0 0 20 units box
fix impact mobile nve
run 0
